  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Local Economic Development to Enhance Employment Prospects in Lebanon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In response to the deteriorating socioeconomic conditions in Lebanon, this project aims to provide livelihood and employment opportunities to vulnerable Lebanese and Syrian refugees through the provision of direct employment, and support to small and medium enterprises demonstrating commercial viability and the ability to generate employment. The project aims to mitigate increased risks of irregular migration and community destabilization by helping financially struggling individuals and families, with an equal breakdown between host and displaced beneficiaries, while also striving to promote female access to livelihood opportunities.</narrative>
  </description>
